  <item>
    <title>我的共创经历不完全回顾</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67602eef7d8426f692931067</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67602eef7d8426f692931067</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 17 Dec 2024 23:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，今天和大家分享的是我和共创的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>从2017年接触到共创开始，就一直在一边实践和学习。共创的形式也可以是多种多样的。 因此今天想要和大家分享一下我过去在社会创新和商业领域的一些共创实践。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="76">1:16</a> 加入upbeing 行动村，社会创新&amp;项目式学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="315">5:15</a> 四川丹巴花椒共创项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="860">14:20</a> 变废为宝竞合项目式学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1055">17:35</a> EDE生态社区课程学习</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2040">34:00</a>香港 美国运通领导力课程+洋泾社区社会创新工作坊</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2258">37:38</a> 社区杂志共创项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2456">40:56</a> 社区共创戏剧</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2588">43:08</a> 控江中学社区创新项目</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3000">50:00</a> 公共领域共创的挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3384">56:24</a> 共创到底是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3480">58:00</a> 工作坊的“然后”是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3540">59:00</a> 企业里的共创创新挑战</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="60">1:00</a> 品牌里的共创如何做？</span></p><span></span><p><span>四川丹巴花椒共创项目</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OCFBUqHEmeQ9u8v-cB90WA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/OCFBUqHEmeQ9u8v-cB90WA"><span>半工半 X 的生态村推动之旅</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DqoXXkFciBLaB7FjAS67WQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/DqoXXkFciBLaB7FjAS67WQ"><span>支持八名山区孩子创变，也向神山买一份诚食</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><p><span>社区文创在洋泾社区：</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MF8ls0mMgt31O9kW58xYug" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/MF8ls0mMgt31O9kW58xYug"><span>社区文创回顾|阿姨今天忙着签了3个大单</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>控江中学社区文创</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_sAxeL9tEB2s6qx2SINwnQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/_sAxeL9tEB2s6qx2SINwnQ"><span>控江中学文创导航X 定海社区文化行走</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/f6o4UFk-ARbt3lecQE3bAA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/f6o4UFk-ARbt3lecQE3bAA"><span>社区PBL课程案例：学校X社区X社会</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KkIg_artisXcy5i0yimhIw" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/KkIg_artisXcy5i0yimhIw"><span>控江中学x定海社区|从城市受益者向城市设计师的视角转变</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>社区杂志：</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YICD1hziIMCeWpTfFkk55w" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/YICD1hziIMCeWpTfFkk55w"><span>社区文创 | 一本由学生和居民参与创作的社区杂志</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5psGBCHhL0C_prthQH5pEA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/5psGBCHhL0C_prthQH5pEA"><span>合作设|四平社区杂志的众包日记(附免费下载)</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>社区共创戏剧：&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u43s3EXmHN8_GLXbloS7VQ" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/u43s3EXmHN8_GLXbloS7VQ"><span>七名跨代际行动者的纪实民众剧场演出</span></a></h1><span></span><p><span>共创在商业中的实践</span></p><span></span><h1><a href="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qRMdtasPWvWDQoHwlCPzdA" data-url="https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/qRMdtasPWvWDQoHwlCPzdA"><span>共创，一种帮助我们从买卖关系发展到 1+1大于2的合作伙伴的方法？</span></a></h1><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><p><span>在香港参加的美国运通Common purpose 领导力课程：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a data-url="https://commonpurpose.org/" href="https://commonpurpose.org/">commonpurpose.org</a></span></p><span></span><h1><span>我参与的泰国Gaia Ashram 态村设计教育（EDE）课程:</span></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://gaiaschoolasia.com/ecovillage-design-education/" data-url="https://gaiaschoolasia.com/ecovillage-design-education/"><span>gaiaschoolasia.com</span></a></p><span></span><h1><span>Global Ecovillage Network</span></h1><span></span><p><a href="https://ecovillage.org/" data-url="https://ecovillage.org/"><span>ecovillage.org</span></a></p><span></span><h1><br></h1><span></span><p><span>不知道有没有听众发现我的播客这期没有丝毫噪音了，因为我使用了这款Vocot播客编辑器，</span></p><span></span><p><span>真的特别好用，一点噪音都没有了，特别的强，强推！</span></p><span></span><p><span>Vocot专属优惠购买链接： </span><a href="https://www.vocut.com/pricing?code=pandas" data-url="https://www.vocut.com/pricing?code=pandas"><span>www.vocut.com</span></a><span>，通过这个链接购买的话，在年包优惠的基础上还额外叠加了一个潘达专属优惠哟：年付立刻节省20% 。</span></p>]]></description>
