  <item>
    <title>《优质客户体验背后的10个原则》用客户体验塑造品牌？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/666be6acb6a8412729b5198a</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">666be6acb6a8412729b5198a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 17 Jun 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>大家好，今天和大家分享的是The Ten Principles Behind Great Customer Experiences(<a data-url="https://book.douban.com/subject/11896368/" href="https://book.douban.com/subject/11896368/">book.douban.com</a>) 这本书里的内容。这本书分享了10个好的客户体验原则，非常的精彩。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="45">00:45</a> 什么是客户体验</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="159">2:39</a> Great customer experiences strongly reflect the customer's identity 好的客户体验可以反应我们的客户身份</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="590">9:50</a> Great customer experiences satisfy our higher objectives &nbsp;好的客户体验可以满足我们高层次的目标</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1525">25:25</a> Great customer experiences leave nothing to chance &nbsp;好的客户体验关注到每一个细节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> Great customer experiences set and then meet expectations 好的客户体验会制定并满足客户期待。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2870">47:50</a> Great customer experiences are effortless 好的客户体验是不费力的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3570">59:30</a> Great customer experiences are stress free 好的客户体验是无压力的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4040">1:07:20</a>Great customer experiences indulge the senses 好的客户体验是考虑五感的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4655">1:17:35</a> Great customer experiences are socially engaging 好的客户体验是有社交参与感的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5187">1:26:27</a> Great customer experiences put the customer in control 好的客户体验让客户感到是可控的</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5720">1:35:20</a> Great customer experiences consider the emotions? 好的客户体验会考虑到客户的情感</span></p><span></span><p><span>【关于我】</span></p><span></span><p><span>半路出家全靠自学的服务设计师，在这边分享各种服务设计，创新设计的工作学习心得</span></p><span></span><p><span>由于不希望播客和公众号内容重复，所以公众号更新的相对更频繁，欢迎订阅公众号：SPECTRUM 发光潘达</span></p><span></span><p><span>【过往经验】</span></p><span></span><p><span>过往设计项目涉及：机场快线服务设计，社区服务设计，民宿服务体验设计，酒吧服务体验设计，五金产品to C端服务设计等</span></p><span></span><p><span>【合作】</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎各位有服务体验需求的老板加我微信交流，项目服务包括：</span></p><span></span><p><span>服务战略设计（包括价值主张等）</span></p><span></span><p><span>服务体验设计（优化你的服务体验，避免一味的卷价格）</span></p><span></span><p><span>【加听友群】</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>欢迎大家加pandaqr进入咱们的听友群～</span></strong></p>]]></description>
